  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Drought Response in Isiolo, 2006</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will build upon the immediate drought response work undertaken by these Diocese Development Teams between March and July 06.  The purpose of this project is to improve food security and reduce malnutrition and morbidity of at least 18,000 in Isiolo and Kitui districts through the provision of supplementary food to the most vulnerable population, through the provision of essential medicines to health facilities, through the provision of livestock support services and through improving access to water for 6 months</narrative>
  </description>
